[{"title":"木兰花慢·赴杭转沪，往视姊，赋此示澄宇，兼辞黄山","author":"陈家庆","text":"翠微招隐处，记携酒，访山灵。\n正听雨樽前，餐霞物外，渐隔红尘。\n同珍。\n清游岁月，只相期、不负百年身。\n留取吟怀依旧，他年来伴松筠。\n芳辰。\n吟袖暂分携，欲语意难伸。\n叹无端小别，愁凝远黛，梦逐飙轮。\n微颦。\n猿惊鹤怨，问何时、重作避秦人。\n待写银钩小字，尺书遥倩江鳞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南·澄宇以青龙潭漘所得石制一砚，曰桃华砚，书至，制小词二首覆之 其一","author":"陈家庆","text":"桃华砚，秋水正盈盈。\n曾伴高人吟晚翠，空山明月写幽情。\n片石拟连城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南·澄宇以青龙潭漘所得石制一砚，曰桃华砚，书至，制小词二首覆之 其二","author":"陈家庆","text":"桃华砚，黛色杂琼英。\n腕底烟云惊纸贵，夜窗风雨作龙吟。\n掷地有金声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十八","author":"丘逢甲","text":"生平未睹此中天，好向居人叩末颠。\n遍地槟榔传几代，从头乞为话便便。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十七","author":"丘逢甲","text":"白露满天蝙蝠飞，寒阶枯坐水生衣。\n竹丝闻续烧三丈，心烬待郎郎未归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十六","author":"丘逢甲","text":"贺酒新婚社宴罗，双携雀嫂与沙哥。\n鼻箫吹裂前峰月，齐叩铜镮起跳歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十五","author":"丘逢甲","text":"为怜归燕一开门，斜日红棉易断魂。\n燕子自双人自独，此情消得几黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"铁笛吹来竹外烟，梅花消息素怀牵。\n瑶台芳讯来何暮，惆怅溪桥欲雪天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"盘顶红绸里髻丫，细腰雏女学当家。\n携篮逐队随娘去，九十九峰采竹芽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"大东门接小东过，衾艳衣香羡此多。\n闻说花田重徵税，花排花串价增高。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"罂粟花开别样鲜，阿芙蓉毒满台天。\n可怜驵侩皆诗格，耸起一双山字肩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5446,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其九","author":"丘逢甲","text":"门栏惨绿蜃楼新，道左耶稣最诱民。\n七十七堂宣跪拜，痴顽齐礼泰西人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5447,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"东宁西畔树降旗，六月天兴震叠师。\n从此东周遗老尽，更无人赋采薇诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5448,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其八","author":"丘逢甲","text":"番社曈昽曙色开，鎗雷箭雨打围回。\n黍罂酒热朝餐早，手擘奇柑煮鹿胎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5449,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其七","author":"丘逢甲","text":"任他颜色照银泥，一样朱唇黑齿齐。\n螓首蛾眉都易事，教人难觅是瓠犀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5450,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其六","author":"丘逢甲","text":"菊满东篱荷满池，少寒多暖鹭洲诗。\n星轺不到鸡笼岛，寒彻罗衣总未知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5451,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其五","author":"丘逢甲","text":"峰头烈焰火光奇，南纪岗峦仰大维。\n寄语沸泉休太热，出山终有冻流时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5452,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"教士都凭器识先，海东旧院剧云连。\n岱云去作三山雨，灯火荒凉四十年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5453,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"鼾睡他人未肯容，开山新议达宸衷。\n荒山逐渐开硗确，草草何能便浚封。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5454,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"北园荒草几经春，监国不亡国岂沦。\n若究祸端肇亡国，九原应怨董夫人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5455,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其十","author":"丘逢甲","text":"竹子高高百尺幡，盂兰胜会话中原。\n寻常一饭艰难甚，粱肉如山饷鬼门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5456,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三十四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"晚凉新曲按琵琶，茉莉花开日已斜。\n一担香风满城送，深宵散作助情花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5457,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三十五","author":"丘逢甲","text":"半种花园半种田，儿家生计总由天。\n楝花风后黄梅雨，满地珍珠不计钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5458,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三十二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"番檨花开又一年，不寒不暖早春天。\n开正复喜开春宴，赢得诗狂更酒颠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5459,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三十七","author":"丘逢甲","text":"风光绝胜说江城，树里湖容一片明。\n拟刺朱家船子去，万荷花里读书声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5460,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三十八","author":"丘逢甲","text":"红罗检点嫁衣裳，艳说糖团馈婿乡。\n十斛槟榔万蕉果，高歌黄竹女儿箱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5461,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三十","author":"丘逢甲","text":"好吟应是太痴生，笔墨因缘记不清。\n谁把四弦弹夜月，新词唱遍赤嵌城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5462,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三十六","author":"丘逢甲","text":"黑海惊涛大小洋，草鸡亲手辟洪荒。\n一重苦雾一重瘴，人在腥风蜑雨乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5463,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十九","author":"丘逢甲","text":"唱罢迎神又送神，港南港北草如茵。\n谁家马上佳公子，不看神仙祇看人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5464,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其三十一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"鲲鯓香雨竹溪孤，海气笼沙罨画图。\n衬出觉王金偈地，斑支花蕊绿珊瑚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5465,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十七","author":"丘逢甲","text":"牛车辘辘走如雷，日日城东去复回。\n红豆满车都载过，相思载不出城来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5466,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十八","author":"丘逢甲","text":"相约明朝好进香，翻新花样到衣裳。\n低梳两鬓花双插，要斗时新上海妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5467,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十六","author":"丘逢甲","text":"竹边竹接屋边屋，花外花连楼外楼。\n客燕不来泥滑滑，满城风雨正骑秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5468,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十五","author":"丘逢甲","text":"水仙宫外水通潮，潮去潮来暮又朝。\n几阵好风吹得到，碧桃花下听吹箫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5469,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"浮槎真个到天边，轻暖轻寒别有天。\n树是珊瑚花是玉，果然过海便神仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5470,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"师泉拜后阵云屯，夜半潮高鹿耳门。\n如此江山偏舍去，年年芳草怨王孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5471,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"自设屏藩障海滨，荒陬从此沐皇仁。\n将军不死降王去，无复田横五百人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5472,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"印收监国剧堪嗟，泪洒孤坟日已斜。\n城北城西千万树，哀魂应化杜鹃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5473,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾竹枝词 其二十","author":"丘逢甲","text":"唐山流寓话巢痕，潮惠漳泉齿最繁。\n二百年来蕃衍后，寄生小草已深根。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5474,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其十一","author":"蔡见先","text":"食福年终是尾牙，盛筵今日请头家。\n可怜索债从兹急，安得台高好避他。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5475,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其十","author":"蔡见先","text":"拌米为丸腻比脂，祀神祭祖两相宜。\n初来新妇宜男相，一粒投炉卜已知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5476,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其九","author":"蔡见先","text":"虎头山畔听潮前，此日风高又一年。\n遍语插萸诸弟辈，题糕莫负菊花天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5477,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其八","author":"蔡见先","text":"月到中秋分外殊，尝新有饼美于酴。\n良宵忙煞痴儿女，牧豕槽边问椅姑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5478,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其七","author":"蔡见先","text":"香花酒果列多盘，高供巍巍七妈坛。\n有巧似知人尽乞，小儿身上乞平安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5479,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其三","author":"蔡见先","text":"纷纷牲醴闹头牙，膜拜香烧福德爷。\n农祝丰年商利市，醉人扶过比邻家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5480,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其五","author":"蔡见先","text":"米粽争缠续命丝，斗舟旧事忆潮儿。\n人家邀福心偏胜，蒲艾青苍插满篱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5481,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其十二","author":"蔡见先","text":"共云今夕是辞年，儿女围炉笑语传。\n我独偷閒修酒脯，擘开囊锦祭诗篇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5482,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其二","author":"蔡见先","text":"大开灯市月争明，士女如云结队行。\n更有官民同乐意，管弦谱出太平声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5483,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其一","author":"蔡见先","text":"黎明爆竹换年光，共上大家欢喜场。\n一礼亲朋相问讯，春觞定作几天忙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5484,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苑里年节竹枝词 其六","author":"蔡见先","text":"广设盂兰好道场，慈和宫里闹跄跄。\n阇黎化食浑閒事，大众皈依拜鬼王。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5485,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台阳竹枝词 其三","author":"蔡碧吟","text":"无嫌黑齿聊随俗，吹到门前荖叶香。\n两颊桃花红欲晕，儿家风韵在槟榔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5486,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台阳竹枝词 其二","author":"蔡碧吟","text":"千家茅屋映朝晖，二月人多著暖衣。\n武馆街前锣鼓闹，冈山昨日进香归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5487,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水调歌头·和易同年曼农刑部","author":"刘人熙","text":"乾坤何莽苍，傀儡尽登场。\n都向邯郸梦里，六尺斗昂藏。\n几度莺歌燕舞，更有蝇营狗苟，平白愤苍黄。\n五更鸡报晓，子细试思量。\n牛服箱，箕翕舌，尽荒唐。\n切莫拖泥带水，进退两郎当。\n待我泰山立脚，更向碧霄着眼，天命本无常。\n所思崇令德，努力爱时光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5488,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高阳台·为荫阶老前辈题绿天草庵瀹茗图1893","author":"况周颐","text":"阁小留香，庭深种纸，旗枪镇日流连。\n玉麈同挥，墨林风调翩翩。\n何须浊酒浇胸臆，指层楼、慵问诗仙。\n晚凉天。\n红涤纤尘，翠里疏烟。\n水西觞咏家风旧，便云萍小住，也足清缘。\n花底朝回，怀人句写鸾笺。\n春风细啜红薇露，玉壶清、风味依然。\n擘龙团。\n分绿窗纱，长共婵娟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5489,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙·集珠玉词句，题和珠玉词1894","author":"况周颐","text":"一曲新词酒一杯。\n小屏闲放画帘垂。\n劝君莫惜金缕衣。\n只有醉吟宽别恨，且留双泪说相思。\n旧欢前事入颦眉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5490,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"临江仙·集珠玉词句，题和珠玉词1894","author":"况周颐","text":"一霎秋风惊画扇，那堪飞绿纷纷。\n无情有意且休论。\n楼高目断，依约驻行云。\n谁把钿筝移玉柱，不辞遍唱阳春。\n等闲离别易销魂。\n红笺小字，留赠意中人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5491,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水龙吟·题金溎笙辑宋刘师勇表忠录","author":"况周颐","text":"荒江咽遍寒潮，吊忠更酹兰陵酒。\n英灵如昨，重围矢石，孤城刁斗。\n画饼偏安，醇醪末路，壮怀空负。\n说生平意气，题诗射塔，试旋斡，乾坤手。\n炎徼重寻祠墓，瘴云深、鹤归来否。\n琼崖玉骨，赤溪血泪，蛮神呵守。\n五百年来，天时人事，淋浪襟?。\n?鼓鼙悲壮，愿屠鲸鳄，为将军寿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5492,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮·美人辫发1912","author":"况周颐","text":"同根三绺青丝绾。\n丝丝比并情长短。\n背立画图中。\n巫云一段松。\n衫罗防污却。\n巧制乌绫托。\n私问上鬟期。\n平添阿母疑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5493,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字浣溪沙·美人唇1912","author":"况周颐","text":"记向瑶窗写韵成。\n重轻音里识双声。\n石榴娇欲竞珠樱。\n笛孔腻分脂晕浥，绣绒香带唾花凝。\n怜卿吻合是深情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5494,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沁园春·美人舌1912","author":"况周颐","text":"慧茁心苗，欲度灵犀，温黁自然。\n恰鹦帘客去，香留茶酽，鸾笺句秀，粲说花妍。\n金籥深扃，玉津密漱，消得神方长驻颜。\n围曾解，羡澜翻清辩，巾帼仪连。\n簪花格最婵娟。\n更妙吮香毫越恁圆。\n甚小玉偏饶，幽怀易泻，阿侯乍学，泥语轻怜。\n一角溪山，广长真谛，只在红楼斜照边。\n閒凭吊，忆楚宫凄怨，扪竟三年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5495,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字浣溪沙·美人颈1912","author":"况周颐","text":"延秀雒川鹤未翔。\n蝤蛴玉映镜中妆。\n低垂腻粉却羞郎。\n书雁迟回劳引望，绣鸳偎傍惯交相。\n溜钗情味亸鬟香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5496,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凤凰台上忆吹箫·美人胸1912","author":"况周颐","text":"酥嫩云饶，兰香粉著，罗裙半露还藏。\n乍领巾微褪，一缕幽香。\n依约玉山高并，皑皑雪、宛在中央。\n难消遣，填膺别恨，积臆春伤。\n闺房。\n别饶光霁，只风月叨陪，侥倖檀郎。\n更三生慧业，锦绣罗将。\n云是扫眉才子，浑不让、列宿文章。\n论丘壑，遥山澹浓，占断眉场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5497,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字浣溪沙·美人腹1912","author":"况周颐","text":"妙相规前写秘辛。\n圆肌粉致麝脐温。\n个中常满玉精神。\n郎若推心谁与置，天教贮恨不堪扪。\n輖饥可奈别经春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5498,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白蘋香·美人腹1912","author":"况周颐","text":"属稿未须凤纸，兜罗稳称琼肌。\n宣文艳说女总师。\n不数便便经笥。\n玉抱香词惯倚。\n珠胎消息还疑。\n画眉也不合时宜。\n约略檀奴风味。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5499,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字浣溪沙·美人脐1912","author":"况周颐","text":"可可珠容半寸余。\n麝熏温腻较何如。\n带罗微勒惜凝酥。\n酒到暂能酡绛靥，药香长藉煖琼肤。\n梦中日入叶祯符。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5500,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇·今美人足1912","author":"况周颐","text":"踏花行遍，任匆匆、不愁香径苔滑。\n六寸圆肤天然秀，稳称身材玉立。\n袜不生尘，版还参玉，二妙兼香洁。\n平头软绣，凤翘无此宁贴。\n花外来上鞦韆，那须推送，曳起湘裙摺。\n试昉鞋杯传绮席，小户料应愁绝。\n弟一销魂，温存鸳被底，柔如无骨。\n同偕谶好，向郎乞借吟舄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5501,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花·美人骨1912","author":"况周颐","text":"阳秋皮里。\n何止肉匀肌理腻。\n玉莹冰清。\n无俗偏宜百媚生。\n银屏读曲。\n药店飞龙为谁出。\n坦腹才难。\n消得文章比建安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5502,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金缕曲·美人骨1912","author":"况周颐","text":"画笔应难到。\n称冰肌、清凉无汗，摩诃秋早。\n妙像应图天然秀，难得神清更好。\n怜璅子、掌中娇小。\n不把画场双眉斗，恰青衫、未抵红裙傲。\n论高格，九仙抱。\n嗤他皮相争颦笑。\n漫销魂、花柔疑没，肉匀足冒。\n可奈相思深如刻，瘦损香桃多少。\n怕玉比、玲珑难肖。\n知己半生除红粉，莫艰难、市骏金台道。\n只无俗，是同调。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5503,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字浣溪沙·美人肉","author":"况周颐","text":"丝竹平章总不如。\n屏风谁列十眉图。\n收藏惯贴是郎书。\n似燕瘦才能冒骨，如环丰却不垂腴。\n鸡头得似软温无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5504,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]